{{MainIcon|alt=Event-Icon}}
'''Events''' are bonus activities for [[Students]] outside of their [[Courses]]. Different [[Rooms]] can host different events, and some events may require specific [[Items]]. Each event costs [[Money]] to schedule, but they can give the participating [[Students]] extra benefits. With the exception of competitions, each event has an option to repeat on an annual basis. Students will frequently request events in order to complete their own [[Personal Goals]].

==List of Events==
===[[File:Competition-Icon.png|32px]] Competitions===
Competitions are used to test the skills of the highest-ranking [[Students]] in the associated [[Course]]. If the guest inspector is impressed, or the visiting opponent is bested, the [[Campus]] will receive rewards of [[Kudosh]] and [[Money]].

Student performance in competitions can be increased by focusing on their academic performance and raising their levels, by [[training]] [[Teachers]], [[upgrading]] [[Course]] [[Equipment]] and using [[Items]] and other Events that boost [[Learning Power]].

