'''Traits''' are modifiers for the [[Staff]] and [[Students]] on [[Campus]]. Each Pointian will have at between one and three traits, in any combination except those that are directly contradictory, such as Iron Bladder and Weak Bladder. Traits are permanent, they cannot be added to or removed.

In addition, [[Club]] affiliations and levels will be listed in the Traits section of the Student [[Students#Inspector|Inspector]]. These are described in detail on the [[Clubs]] page.

Outside of the Archetypal section, Traits marked with a {{i|Student|28px|alt=Student-Icon|br=no}} will only appear for Students, never for Staff.

